{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MolecularConstruction.H2oMolecularBraid","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MolecularConstruction.H2oMolecularBraid","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.water_h_swap_symmetry","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.water_h_swap_symmetry","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-molecular-braid.lean#L48-L52","doc":"**C₂ᵥ from the projector stabiliser.** Exchanging the two hydrogens\nfixes the strand-partition — the two H sub-units carry equal strand count —\nso it fixes the assembly projector `e_{λ,μ}`. This `S₂` stabiliser is the\n`C₂ᵥ` symmetry of water, the H₂O analogue of benzene's `S₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.swapH","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.swapH","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-molecular-braid.lean#L43-L46","doc":"Exchange of the two hydrogen sub-units (swap of the 2nd and 3rd parts). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.water_numGenerators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.water_numGenerators","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-molecular-braid.lean#L40-L41","doc":"Intra-unit generators `N − k = 25`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.water_numBonding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.water_numBonding","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-molecular-braid.lean#L37-L38","doc":"Bonding (cross-block) generators `k − 1 = 2`: the two O–H σ-bonds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.water_numUnits","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.water_numUnits","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-molecular-braid.lean#L34-L35","doc":"Three sub-units: `O`, `H₁`, `H₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.water_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.water_total","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-molecular-braid.lean#L31-L32","doc":"Total strand count `N = 28`: H₂O is a braid in `H₂₈(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Molecular.waterParts","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Molecular.waterParts","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-molecular-braid.lean#L27-L29","doc":"The H₂O molecular strand-partition `λ = (24, 2, 2)`: oxygen `O(8,8)`\n(24 strands) and two hydrogens (2 strands each). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:h2o-molecular-braid","label":"def:h2o-molecular-braid","md":"quantum-observable-universe/molecular-construction/h2o-molecular-braid.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}